WEBVTT

01:10.570 --> 01:12.400
Isn't this...

01:13.400 --> 01:15.570
Emma Frost?

01:15.570 --> 01:20.330
You mean Emma Frost,
the White Queen of the Inner Circle?

01:20.330 --> 01:21.120
Yes...

01:21.790 --> 01:24.500
she's an incredibly powerful
mutant telepath.

01:25.000 --> 01:29.630
Huh, so what's she doing taking a nap
in the middle of the U-Men's hideout?

01:33.010 --> 01:33.970
<i>You...</i>

01:34.670 --> 01:37.300
<i>you were the one
who manipulated Jean...</i>

01:42.180 --> 01:43.730
She mind-controlled Jean?

01:42.260 --> 01:48.310
<b><i>Armor - Awakening</i></b>

01:44.600 --> 01:46.140
What're you trying to say?

01:46.980 --> 01:51.730
Emma Frost was the one who was controlling
Jean when she went berserk.

01:52.110 --> 01:52.980
What!?

01:53.530 --> 01:56.780
I could see Frost behind Jean when
she had turned into the Phoenix...

01:59.660 --> 02:00.160
Wait!

02:00.990 --> 02:04.500
We were there as well,
but didn't see any sign of her.

02:04.500 --> 02:07.420
Jean pulled me right in front of
her as it was happening.

02:07.420 --> 02:09.210
I saw Frost myself.

02:09.750 --> 02:10.630
No doubt about it.

02:12.130 --> 02:15.210
Jean was desperate to
regain control, but she...

02:16.090 --> 02:20.930
That means she killed
Jean, doesn't it?

02:20.930 --> 02:27.230
Wolverine, Jean ended her own life,
to save us and the whole world.

02:28.060 --> 02:31.480
If she's the one
that pushed Jean to do it,

02:31.480 --> 02:33.230
what difference does it make!?

02:37.900 --> 02:39.240
What do you think
you're doing!?

02:39.990 --> 02:44.330
We're here to rescue Hisako lchiki,
not kill Emma Frost.

02:44.330 --> 02:45.790
You got a screw loose, bub!?

02:47.830 --> 02:51.130
When the time comes,
I'll kill her myself.

02:56.510 --> 03:01.680
It certainly wouldn't be fair to attack
while she's sleeping, after all.

03:01.680 --> 03:02.800
It ain't some joke!

03:03.100 --> 03:04.760
I'm talking about
revenge for Jean!

03:05.850 --> 03:07.930
If you want to do it
so badly, go ahead.

03:08.690 --> 03:11.150
But that'll make you
no better than

03:11.150 --> 03:13.560
the mutant criminals
in the Inner Circle.

03:42.680 --> 03:47.770
You're letting them take mutant specimens
we worked so hard to obtain!

03:47.770 --> 03:49.020
We have to attack!

03:49.520 --> 03:51.270
Hold on, doctor.

03:51.270 --> 03:56.400
Do you realize what an opportunity it is,
to have the X-Men come to us?

03:56.940 --> 04:00.490
We're better off gathering as much data
as possible, to ensure future victory.

04:00.490 --> 04:02.660
We have plenty of data

04:02.660 --> 04:05.280
This is the <i>X-Men</i>
we're talking about.

04:05.280 --> 04:07.490
They may still have
more tricks up their sleeve.

04:09.250 --> 04:13.080
The most important thing to have
when going into a battle is intel!

04:14.710 --> 04:17.420
Seal off the room where
we're keeping the mutants!

04:18.130 --> 04:19.090
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

04:21.380 --> 04:23.090
I killed Jean Grey?

04:24.140 --> 04:28.350
We're asking if you fucked with her head
telepathically and forced her to kill herself.

04:29.180 --> 04:29.970
Now, answer!

04:30.560 --> 04:34.600
I had heard about your battle
against the Inner Circle last year...

04:35.400 --> 04:38.940
but I had left long before then.

04:40.150 --> 04:40.940
You left?

04:42.740 --> 04:45.620
So, I didn't take part in your battle.

04:45.620 --> 04:48.950
I saw you there,
right before Jean died.

04:48.950 --> 04:52.370
Well, I certainly don't remember that,
so you must be seeing things.

04:53.330 --> 04:59.710
You say that, but you can't expect us
to trust a member of the Inner Circle.

04:59.710 --> 05:01.630
I didn't ask you to trust me...

05:02.590 --> 05:05.550
I'm certain once you have the facts and think
rationally about it, the truth will be obvious.

05:07.050 --> 05:09.760
Why did you leave
the Inner Circle?

05:11.020 --> 05:15.350
I see that unlike a certain
presumptuous young lady,

05:15.350 --> 05:20.150
you're trying to actually asess the situation
with a degree of decorum, Mr. McCoy.

05:20.610 --> 05:22.320
Answer his question!

05:23.440 --> 05:25.400
When I joined the Inner Circle,

05:25.400 --> 05:28.200
they were in pursuit of
certain high-minded ideals.

05:28.990 --> 05:30.790
Which is why I joined them...

05:31.950 --> 05:34.080
But as I worked with them,

05:34.080 --> 05:36.920
I realized the mistake
they were making.

05:36.920 --> 05:38.750
This isn't some simple mistake!

05:39.290 --> 05:40.750
You killed Jean!

05:40.750 --> 05:41.710
Hisako!

05:41.710 --> 05:42.210
Don't move!

05:48.640 --> 05:49.510
Are you awake?

05:50.260 --> 05:55.640
Relax, we're not with the people
who kidnapped you.

06:08.110 --> 06:09.030
Emma!

06:13.120 --> 06:13.950
Emma!

06:14.450 --> 06:15.040
Hisako.

06:19.040 --> 06:21.380
You've overslept, dear.

06:21.380 --> 06:22.340
Emma!

06:22.340 --> 06:25.260
Emma, I've been waiting
a long time for you.

06:25.260 --> 06:26.260
I...

06:26.720 --> 06:27.380
I!

06:28.430 --> 06:30.140
You know this girl?

06:30.930 --> 06:31.510
Yes...

06:32.260 --> 06:36.770
Hisako's parents had asked me
to be her private tutor.

06:37.480 --> 06:42.650
Her power had only ever
manifested once...

06:43.480 --> 06:44.820
We know.

06:44.820 --> 06:48.150
But, she hasn't used her
powers since then, has she?

06:48.150 --> 06:48.650
Yes.

06:49.490 --> 06:52.280
But because of the strange cases

06:52.280 --> 06:54.740
that were happening with
mutants around here,

06:55.410 --> 07:00.670
her parents suspected that
her powers might appear again.

07:01.670 --> 07:06.300
They thought it would be important to have
someone to teach her how to use them...

07:07.340 --> 07:11.010
Unfortunately, it seems
the Xavier Institute had shut down.

07:15.060 --> 07:19.060
Mr. lchiki heard about me
through a friend of his,

07:20.060 --> 07:22.690
and he asked me
to tutor Hisako.

07:24.020 --> 07:27.190
Before I joined the Inner Circle,

07:27.190 --> 07:30.400
I had acted as a teacher
for troubled mutants,

07:30.400 --> 07:33.120
and after I resigned,
I continued where I left off.

07:34.490 --> 07:37.540
At the time, I was teaching
a boy in South America,

07:37.540 --> 07:40.460
and couldn't make it
to Japan right away.

07:42.580 --> 07:47.590
So, I had previously only ever contacted Hisako
via the internet or with my telepathy.

07:50.010 --> 07:51.130
Hi, Hisako.

07:51.840 --> 07:55.100
It seems I'll be able to
visit you in Tohoku soon.

07:55.720 --> 07:57.430
<i>I'm looking forward to it.</i>

07:57.430 --> 07:59.310
<i>I want to meet you in person!</i>

08:00.850 --> 08:02.060
I do, too.

08:04.560 --> 08:08.730
A few days ago, I had received
word about Hisako's disappearance,

08:08.730 --> 08:10.820
and rushed to Japan.

08:11.740 --> 08:15.990
I tried to use my telepathy
to locate her, but

08:15.990 --> 08:18.580
there was no trace
of her anywhere.

08:19.080 --> 08:21.330
Probably because of
whatever's blocking Cerebro...

08:21.330 --> 08:24.750
I went to the woods where
Hisako had gone missing...

08:24.750 --> 08:28.000
and the U-Men captured me.

08:47.860 --> 08:51.610
You were one of the most
powerful members of the Inner Circle...

08:51.610 --> 08:54.570
I have a hard time believing
you'd be caught so easily.

08:54.570 --> 08:58.580
They're all cyborgs -
telepathy isn't effective on them.

08:59.160 --> 09:02.460
I thought the only way to find Hisako
was to let them take me to her.

09:03.250 --> 09:05.670
Well, that's real nice of you...

09:07.080 --> 09:10.210
I wasn't thinking about anything
other than saving Hisako.

09:11.630 --> 09:15.680
Of course,
if the X-Men had been around,

09:15.680 --> 09:17.550
perhaps I wouldn't have
had to take the risk!

09:20.680 --> 09:23.180
Emma, who are they?

09:25.900 --> 09:27.650
You don't need to be afraid.

09:27.650 --> 09:31.570
You'll find that they're some of
the best help a mutant can have.

09:36.280 --> 09:39.870
<i>Intelligence-gathering
protocols downloaded.</i>

09:40.530 --> 09:43.250
<i>Assault drones,
ready for deployment.</i>

09:43.250 --> 09:45.920
Go and give our group of
guests a warm welcome.

09:45.920 --> 09:46.710
<i>Affirmative.</i>

09:54.800 --> 09:59.430
Have I cleared up your suspicions yet,
Mr. Tough-guy?

10:00.890 --> 10:02.430
Hell if I know.

10:03.180 --> 10:04.480
Ask our leader.

10:06.190 --> 10:08.190
I don't intend on trusting
anything you say.

10:09.230 --> 10:11.900
But right now,
getting out of here

10:11.900 --> 10:14.740
and taking Hisako home
is our first priority.

10:16.450 --> 10:20.450
It's strange how there
haven't been any more attacks...

10:21.080 --> 10:23.120
You think they're
on lunch break?

10:23.120 --> 10:26.410
Or maybe they smartened up
and ran away.

10:35.510 --> 10:37.470
You realize you
just jinxed us, right?

10:37.470 --> 10:40.220
C'mon bub,
you could use a little exercise.

10:41.180 --> 10:44.140
Storm, you're still exhausted
from earlier.

10:44.810 --> 10:46.730
Get Emma and Hisako to safety!

10:46.730 --> 10:47.430
Right.

11:05.160 --> 11:07.200
Cyclops, respond!

11:07.960 --> 11:08.620
Beast?

11:08.620 --> 11:09.500
Storm?

11:09.500 --> 11:10.120
Wolverine?

11:27.730 --> 11:29.230
What's going on!?

11:29.690 --> 11:31.440
Hisako, open your eyes.

11:33.150 --> 11:35.230
You're a part of this.

11:36.320 --> 11:38.440
You have to accept that reality.

11:40.910 --> 11:41.700
Emma...

12:33.960 --> 12:34.750
Why?

12:35.210 --> 12:37.340
Why is there this
mental fog blocking me

12:37.340 --> 12:39.510
whenever I try to sense
what's going on in Tohoku?

12:40.170 --> 12:42.880
And that child
from my dreams...

12:43.680 --> 12:44.340
Could...

12:45.680 --> 12:46.850
could it be?

12:54.230 --> 12:55.650
I don't like this.

12:56.360 --> 12:58.400
It feels like we're being baited.

12:59.190 --> 13:01.190
Wanna take a detour?

13:03.400 --> 13:04.530
And this is your detour?

13:05.200 --> 13:08.490
Well, I don't see no
VIP elevator for us to use.

13:10.450 --> 13:13.370
<i>The X-Men have vanished
from surveillance.</i>

13:14.080 --> 13:15.960
<i>We're unable to monitor them.</i>

13:18.460 --> 13:20.550
Leave this to me...

13:26.050 --> 13:26.890
What's wrong?

13:27.680 --> 13:30.680
I think whatever they used to
suppress my powers has worn off...

13:31.350 --> 13:33.810
I was able to hear one of
the U-Men's thoughts.

13:34.560 --> 13:37.230
It seems they intended to
analyze your powers

13:37.230 --> 13:40.480
with the equipment
they had in those tunnels.

13:53.080 --> 13:54.460
What is this place?

13:55.080 --> 13:57.210
It looks like an operating room...

13:57.210 --> 13:58.790
Kind of big, ain't it?

14:05.970 --> 14:06.970
Don't touch that!

14:10.510 --> 14:12.850
Those are the samples
we've gathered

14:12.850 --> 14:15.270
from draining the bodily fluids
of you mutant scum...

14:16.350 --> 14:18.100
so that we, the U-Men,

14:18.100 --> 14:21.320
can further empower ourselves...

14:25.360 --> 14:30.870
I think I'd like to take
your precious fluids next!

14:32.530 --> 14:34.950
C'mon robocreep!

14:44.000 --> 14:45.010
Cyclops!

14:49.510 --> 14:50.930
You son of a-

15:10.860 --> 15:15.790
Wolverine's adamantium-laced
skeleton is keeping him immobilized

15:15.790 --> 15:18.210
in this magnetic field!

15:18.210 --> 15:21.920
We have all the data
we need to beat you!

15:23.000 --> 15:23.790
Dammit!

15:26.050 --> 15:27.010
Whoa there!

15:27.670 --> 15:30.930
Settle down, weather girl!

15:34.680 --> 15:39.390
Now, surrender your
natural fluids!

15:42.730 --> 15:43.810
Fluids...

15:44.190 --> 15:46.020
fluids!

15:46.570 --> 15:48.400
Fluids!

15:51.070 --> 15:54.370
Fluids...

15:54.830 --> 15:55.080
Fluids!

15:55.080 --> 15:55.910
Fluids!
It's no good...

15:55.910 --> 15:56.290
Fluids!

15:56.290 --> 15:56.370
Fluids!
his mind is in complete disarray.

15:56.370 --> 15:58.450
Fluids! Your fluids!
his mind is in complete disarray.

15:58.450 --> 16:00.210
Fluids! Your fluids!
My telepathy isn't affecting him!

16:00.210 --> 16:02.170
Fluids! Your fluids!

16:19.100 --> 16:20.350
Now's our chance!

16:20.350 --> 16:21.310
Hurry!

16:25.360 --> 16:29.820
Fluids!

16:34.110 --> 16:36.240
I won't let you lay
a hand on her!

16:40.200 --> 16:43.080
I'll start with your fluids, then!

16:52.010 --> 16:52.760
What?

16:54.050 --> 16:54.720
Hisako...

16:55.300 --> 16:57.510
If you hurt Emma...

16:58.350 --> 16:59.560
I'll hurt you!

17:05.770 --> 17:08.360
Damn you!

17:32.460 --> 17:33.470
She did it.

17:34.340 --> 17:36.430
Was that Hisako's power!?

17:39.680 --> 17:43.480
Hisako has the ability to
mentally project

17:43.480 --> 17:45.980
a powerful suit of
energy armor.

17:48.610 --> 17:51.900
Nooo!

17:51.900 --> 17:52.400
Hisako!

17:55.700 --> 17:56.700
I...

17:56.700 --> 17:57.910
what's happening!?

17:57.910 --> 17:59.700
I'm so hot...

17:59.700 --> 18:01.410
I can't hear anything...

18:01.410 --> 18:02.160
Emma...

18:02.160 --> 18:03.330
Emma, where are you!?

18:04.000 --> 18:05.120
I...

18:05.460 --> 18:06.540
I!

18:08.830 --> 18:09.540
Hisako!

18:10.250 --> 18:14.010
She hasn't used her power enough
to know how to control it!

18:14.010 --> 18:14.720
Emma...

18:14.720 --> 18:15.670
where are you!?

18:15.670 --> 18:16.630
Somebody!

18:16.630 --> 18:18.510
Somebody stop this!

18:18.890 --> 18:19.890
Hisako, calm down!

18:20.470 --> 18:21.850
It's just like driving a car!

18:22.640 --> 18:23.680
The brakes!

18:24.020 --> 18:25.180
You gotta step on the brakes!

18:26.060 --> 18:27.020
Somebody!

18:27.690 --> 18:29.650
Make it stop!

18:35.320 --> 18:36.320
Cyclops!

18:37.990 --> 18:38.660
Hisako!

18:39.160 --> 18:41.160
Hisako, you have to
snap out of it!

18:41.580 --> 18:43.080
Don't let your power
consume you!

18:49.540 --> 18:50.380
Hisako!

18:51.540 --> 18:52.210
Don't give UP!

18:52.710 --> 18:54.170
Don't let it break you!

18:55.920 --> 18:58.220
I don't know what's going on!

19:01.010 --> 19:01.640
Hisako!

19:02.100 --> 19:03.350
Don't let the power
overwhelm you!

19:03.350 --> 19:04.600
Concentrate!

19:04.600 --> 19:06.680
No!

19:06.680 --> 19:07.890
Have faith!

19:13.320 --> 19:15.190
You have to have faith
in yourself.

19:16.360 --> 19:17.110
Emma...

19:17.990 --> 19:19.860
And in the X-Men.

19:20.410 --> 19:23.410
You need to have faith,
and accept what's happened.

19:24.530 --> 19:26.410
That's your first lesson.

19:29.960 --> 19:31.830
First lesson?

19:33.130 --> 19:33.960
Right.

19:35.800 --> 19:36.510
It's okay.

19:37.090 --> 19:38.720
I know you can handle it.

19:38.720 --> 19:40.180
And I'm here with you.

19:54.650 --> 19:56.860
You've passed your first lesson.

19:57.820 --> 19:58.490
Emma...

19:59.110 --> 20:01.030
You're an excellent student.

20:01.990 --> 20:03.820
And I'm proud of you.

20:06.330 --> 20:07.200
Emma!

20:09.500 --> 20:11.460
This is just my gut talking,

20:11.460 --> 20:15.000
I don't think Emma was responsible
for Jean's death.

20:16.170 --> 20:18.800
I'm not calling you a liar,

20:18.800 --> 20:21.550
but she sure don't seem
like a bad guy.

20:21.550 --> 20:24.180
She's an excellent teacher.

20:24.180 --> 20:25.550
Cyclops...

20:25.550 --> 20:27.470
we have to face facts.

20:28.270 --> 20:29.180
I'm not so sure.

20:29.810 --> 20:31.230
She's a telepath.

20:33.400 --> 20:39.860
She might already be
manipulating us, and Hisako.

20:41.950 --> 20:46.280
The base is a loss,
but we got plenty of data.

20:47.240 --> 20:49.330
Those damned X-Men...

20:50.080 --> 20:52.410
Enjoy your victory, while it lasts.

20:57.590 --> 20:59.250
They're just asleep.

20:59.880 --> 21:00.380
I see.

21:07.720 --> 21:09.680
Charles, Hisako is fine.

21:10.430 --> 21:14.020
We've freed all the young mutants.

21:15.230 --> 21:17.150
Fluids...

21:17.610 --> 21:19.610
fluids...

21:19.980 --> 21:22.570
fluids!!

21:26.110 --> 21:26.870
Hisako!

23:03.800 --> 23:07.550
Emma shields Hisako from a laser blast fired
by one of the remaining U-Men, Todd,

23:08.010 --> 23:09.680
when something strange
happens to her.

23:10.550 --> 23:15.140
The X-Men, with Hisako and Emma in tow,
return to New York and the Xavier Institute,

23:15.140 --> 23:18.020
but along the way, they're attacked
by a mysterious monster.

23:18.940 --> 23:20.230
Where did the monster
come from?

23:20.230 --> 23:24.980
And what uncanny truths
will be revealed by Emma's body?

23:26.030 --> 23:29.200
Next time on X-Men: Secondary Mutation.

23:26.070 --> 23:31.030
<b><i>Transformation - Secondary Mutation</i></b>
